5. INTEGRITY PROTECTION
================================================================================

The Model contains cryptographic watermarks and sentinel tensors embedded at
multiple structural levels. These components are part of the Model and are
protected under this License and applicable copyright law.

  - Removing or altering these components is a violation of this License.
  - The Model is designed such that removal of watermarks will cause
    inference failures. The Owner is not responsible for any malfunction
    resulting from unauthorized tampering.
  - The integrity hash (SHA256:0f734b85dc8c6738df71d27377e652057acd1e7df7c9d623129cba0bce0fcb05)
    serves as a tamper-detection fingerprint for the core model node.

